# 🔄 Project Workflow

## 1. Device Enrollment & Management

Configured Microsoft Intune and Microsoft Entra ID for centralized endpoint management.

Activities included:

- Windows device enrollment
- Android device enrollment
- Device registration and management
- Endpoint monitoring
- Device management through Microsoft Intune

---

## 2. Enrollment Restrictions

Configured enrollment restrictions to control which devices can enroll into the Intune environment.

Activities included:

- Enrollment restriction configuration
- Device platform restrictions
- Device enrollment limits
- Validation of enrollment behavior

---

## 3. Scope Tags

Configured Scope Tags to organize administrative access and management within Microsoft Intune.

Activities included:

- Scope Tag configuration
- Administrative organization
- Resource management

---

## 4. Compliance Policies

Configured compliance policies to evaluate endpoint compliance with organizational requirements.

Activities included:

- Compliance policy creation
- Device compliance configuration
- Compliance evaluation
- Policy validation

---

## 5. Endpoint Security

Configured endpoint security controls for managed Windows devices.

The lab included:

- BitLocker encryption
- Windows Firewall
- Microsoft Defender
- TPM
- Antivirus
- Real-Time Protection

These controls were configured and managed through Microsoft Intune.

---

## 6. Device Configuration

Configured device configuration policies to manage endpoint settings centrally.

Activities included:

- Configuration policy creation
- Device settings management
- Policy assignment
- Configuration validation

---

## 7. Application Management

Configured application deployment and management through Microsoft Intune.

Activities included:

- Application deployment
- Application assignment
- Application management
- Deployment validation

---

## 8. Android App Protection

Configured Android application protection capabilities for managed mobile devices.

Activities included:

- Android App Protection configuration
- Application management
- Policy assignment
- Protection policy validation

---

## 9. Conditional Access

Configured Microsoft Entra ID Conditional Access integration with endpoint management.

Activities included:

- Conditional Access configuration
- Identity-based access controls
- Device compliance integration
- Access policy validation

---

## 10. BitLocker Management

Configured BitLocker encryption management through Microsoft Intune.

Activities included:

- BitLocker configuration
- Encryption policy management
- Device policy assignment
- Encryption management validation

---

## 11. Remote Help & Remote Support

Configured and tested Remote Help / Remote Assistance capabilities for endpoint support.

Activities included:

- Remote Help configuration
- Remote Assistance testing
- Remote device support
- Endpoint troubleshooting
- Remote management validation

